  "text": " Back in 2021, this is what the CDC told us. Was the science so clear? It's certainly not clear now. Delta led to boosters, and Omicron will lead to boosters of boosters. And you can't question their science. But they're really criticizing science. Because I represent science. That's dangerous. Even when their science questions their science. But the boosters still won't make us safe from getting COVID, or giving it to others. Their science couldn't be less clear. The vaccines aren't working, so they're changing the definition of fully vaccinated right in front of us. Additionally, reports from our international colleagues, including Israel, suggest increased risk of severe disease amongst those vaccinated early. What's going on? We have more COVID deaths with the vaccines than we did before the vaccines. What does fully vaccinated even mean now? Do they even know? Do you have to get endless boosters to keep your job? To practice your religion? To travel? To buy food? To learn in school? To exercise your basic rights? And for what? Are things getting better? When do I think things will get back to normal? I've been cautioned not to give an answer to that, because we don't know for sure. And what's coming next? The only thing that is clear? The vaccines aren't working.",
